{
    "reasoner_response": "Let the customer know: "Your claim has been reviewed and the requested repairs have been determined to be outside the scope of your contract coverage. For more information on the specific exclusion, please speak with a claims specialist." Then, immediately proceed to let the customer know you will connect them with a claims specialist for further assistance. Before transferring, say: "Before I connect you — just so you know, you can quickly view claim status, manage your contract, find answers to frequently asked questions, or chat with Customer Care at vehicle care plan dot com." Call me back so I can proceed with the transfer.",
    "communication_rules": [
        "- If the customer tried to change the topic while you are waiting for Supervisor instructions, before following any Reasoner's instructions, ask the customer whether they want to switch to the new topic or continue with the current one.",
        "- If any previous requests were prevented from execution, they can now be re-evaluated and executed if appropriate. Make a new function/tool request to do so."
    ]
}
